# Testing

Use test-driven development. Write a failing test, add the minimum code that makes it pass, then refactor while the tests stay green. Finish those three steps before starting the next behavior.

- Unit tests go in `test/unit`.
- Integration tests go in `test/integration`.
- End-to-end tests go in `test/e2e`.
- Name the test file after the source file it covers.
